        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 1968P, Elite Collection Milano Thru-Bolted Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Milano Door Pull comes packaged with thru-bolt mounting hardware which means the pull bolts through the door. This Modern Omnia 1968P Pull is available in 2 sizes: 12 inch and 18 inch center to center lengths. Choose from a variety of contemporary finish colors. The Elite Collection Milano Thru-Bolted Door Pull is a popular choice for ultra modern homes and businesses that want an air of sophistication and chic style.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Milano Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<b>1968P/305:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 12\"  (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 19/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>1968P/457:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 18\"  (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 18-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 19/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/micheal-door-pull-back-to-back-pair-omnia-btb-1968p\"><b> Omnia 1968P Milano Back-To-Back Pull Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
